SUMMARY:Criminal Presents: Don't Worry with Phoebe Judge
LOCATION:The Bell House\, Carroll Gardens-Cobble Hill-Gowanus-Red Hook
DESCRIPTION:The premise of the podcast Criminal has always been to tell sto
 
ries about people "who've done wrong\, been wronged\, or gotten caught some
 
where in the middle." In this all-new\, intimate\, darkly funny show\, host
 
 Phoebe Judge tells those stories about herself & the people she loves. Gro
 
wing up in an eccentric\, unpredictable family in Chicago\, Judge began dis
 
covering family secrets. Judge shares how those secrets shaped her life - i
 
ncluding the work she does as a journalist & host of a true crime podcast. 
 
Door Time: 6pm (front bar opens: 5pm). Show Time: 7pm. 21 & over w/ valid\,
 
 government-issued photo ID. General Admission standing & seating. *Seating
 
 1st come 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive early for best selection. **I
 
f you have an accessibility request\, please email thebellhouse@livenation.
 
com prior. ***No outside food/drink. $.25 per each ticket sold for a majori
 
ty of events at The Bell House benefits Comedy Gives Back. IG: Tickets & in
 
fo: https://www.ticketmaster.com/criminal-presents-dont-worry-with-phoebe-b
 
